                        {
                          "code": "\n\t\"\"\"\n\tTransform gauge value to color based on range and theme.\n\t\n\tTemporary ranges (adjust based on real data):\n\t- Green (optimal): -0.5 to +0.5\n\t- Yellow (warning): ±0.5 to ±2.0\n\t- Red (critical): \u003e ±2.0\n\t\n\tArgs:\n\t\tvalue (float): Current gauge value\n\t\tquality (int): Tag quality code\n\t\ttimestamp (datetime): Tag timestamp\n\t\n\tReturns:\n\t\tstr: Hex color code based on theme and value range\n\t\"\"\"\n\ttry:\n\t\t# Input variables (for Script Console debugging)\n\t\t# value \u003d 0.3  # Test value\n\t\t\n\t\t# Define thresholds (easily adjustable)\n\t\tOPTIMAL_RANGE \u003d 0.5  # ±0.5 is green\n\t\tWARNING_RANGE \u003d 2.0  # ±2.0 is yellow\n\t\t# Beyond ±2.0 is red\n\t\t\n\t\t# Get current theme\n\t\tcurrentTheme \u003d self.session.props.theme\n\t\t\n\t\t# Determine color based on value range\n\t\tabsValue \u003d abs(value)\n\t\t\n\t\tif absValue \u003c\u003d OPTIMAL_RANGE:\n\t\t\tcolor \u003d \"#0F7F9A\"  # Green - optimal range\n\t\telif absValue \u003c\u003d WARNING_RANGE:\n\t\t\tcolor \u003d \"#FFCD06\"  # Yellow - warning range\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tcolor \u003d \"#F00C2D\"  # Red - critical range\n\t\t\n\t\treturn color\n\t\n\texcept Exception as e:\n\t\tsystem.util.getLogger(\"papos.components.simpleGauge\").error(\"Error transforming gauge color: \" + str(e))\n\t\treturn \"#0F7F9A\"  # Default safe color",
