                          "code": "\n\t\"\"\"\n\tTransform Cpk gauge value to color based on capability index and theme.\n\t\n\tRange: 0 to 5\n\tCpk Industry Standards:\n\t- Cpk \u003e\u003d 1.67: Green (Excellent - 6 sigma capability)\n\t- 1.33 \u003c\u003d Cpk \u003c 1.67: Light green (Acceptable - 4 sigma)\n\t- 1.00 \u003c\u003d Cpk \u003c 1.33: Yellow (Minimum acceptable - 3 sigma)\n\t- Cpk \u003c 1.00: Red (Unacceptable - process not capable)\n\t\n\tArgs:\n\t\tvalue (float): Current Cpk value (0 to 5)\n\t\tquality (int): Tag quality code\n\t\ttimestamp (datetime): Tag timestamp\n\t\n\tReturns:\n\t\tstr: Hex color code based on theme and Cpk value\n\t\"\"\"\n\ttry:\n\t\t# Input variables (for Script Console debugging)\n\t\t# value \u003d 1.5  # Test Cpk value\n\t\t# theme \u003d \"cla-light\"  # or \"cla-dark\"\n\t\t\n\t\t# Get current theme\n\t\tcurrentTheme \u003d self.session.props.theme\n\t\t\n\t\t# Determine color based on Cpk value and theme\n\t\tif currentTheme \u003d\u003d \"cla-light\":\n\t\t\tif value \u003e\u003d 1.67:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#0F7F9A\"  # Green - excellent capability\n\t\t\telif value \u003e\u003d 1.33:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#FFCD06\"  # Yellow-green - acceptable\n\t\t\telif value \u003e\u003d 1.00:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#FFCD06\"  # Yellow - minimum acceptable\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#F00C2D\"  # Red - unacceptable\n\t\t\n\t\telif currentTheme \u003d\u003d \"cla-dark\":\n\t\t\tif value \u003e\u003d 1.67:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#0F7F9A\"  # Green - excellent capability\n\t\t\telif value \u003e\u003d 1.33:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#FFCD06\"  # Yellow-green - acceptable\n\t\t\telif value \u003e\u003d 1.00:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#FFCD06\"  # Yellow - minimum acceptable\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\treturn \"#F00C2D\"  # Red - unacceptable\n\t\t\n\t\t# Default color if theme not recognized\n\t\treturn \"#0F7F9A\"\n\t\n\texcept Exception as e:\n\t\tsystem.util.getLogger(\"papos.components.simpleGauge\").error(\"Error transforming Cpk gauge color: \" + str(e))\n\t\treturn \"#0F7F9A\"  # Default safe color",
